   "answer": "Island Breeze Seniors Day Program is a <strong>not-for-profit seniors day program in Markham, Ontario</strong>, for adults 55 and older and the people who care for them. Founded by Charmaine and incorporated in 2018, it offers exercise, chair yoga, games, breakfasts, workshops and outings, with a warm Caribbean welcome."
